Examine the metrics tooltip implementation to understand the pattern for fetching metrics.

Implementation prompt:
1. Search for any cron, scheduler, timer, or background task code in the codebase
2. Examine metrics.py _fetch_metrics_from_model function to understand polling pattern
3. Check how metrics tooltip fetches and displays data in ui-controls.js
4. Verify if llama-server /metrics endpoint pushes or needs polling
5. Document findings in a brief report

